ix expects approximately 0.866 for \"cheeseburger\" and \"cheese fries\", whereas the parent implementation returns approximately 0.911. The reversal restores the exact parent implementation. No tests were executed.", "updated_at": "2026-09-24T00:34:01.953234+00:00"}
